# The build context of packages/rafa-hub/Dockerfile, which copies the
# repository root whole: leave out what the host installed or built, the
# git history, the loop's own state and any local secrets, so the image's
# `bun install --frozen-lockfile` links the workspace from the lockfile alone.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/out
**/.tsbuild
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
.git
.rafa
.ralph
.tmp
.claude/settings.local.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
progress.txt
